  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Satguru Traders vs State Through Food Inspector on 30 July, 2021 Author: Vinod Chatterji Koul Bench: Vinod Chatterji Koul Sr. No. 210 High Court Of Jammu & Kashmir And Ladakh At Jammu Crta No. 33/2015 Ia No. 01/2015 Satguru Traders ... Petitioner/Appellant(s) Through: Mr. Sanjay Sharma, Advocate. v/s State through Food Inspector, Ramban .... Respondent(s) Through: None. Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Vinod Chatterji Koul, Judge Order",
    "facts": "1. The applicant has filed this application seeking transfer of criminal complaint pending before the court of learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Ramban under Section 7(i) read with Section 16(1)(a)(i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 to the court of competent jurisdiction at Rajouri. 2. The transfer of the case has been sought primarily on the ground that the applicant- Chander Kanta is an old aged lady of more than 85 years old and also not in good health. 3. Respondent has filed objections and resisted the transfer of the case on the ground that transfer of the case would cause inconvenience to the witnesses and trial of the case is to be conducted in a court within the jurisdiction of which cause has arisen.",
